{"id": "EUVD-2026-81773", "enisaUuid": "b40825b7-a84b-35cf-9faf-f7609347af9b", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nblock: mtip32xx: synchronize ioctls with device removal\n\nThe ioctl handlers only test REMOVE_PENDING before entering\nmtip_hw_ioctl(). Removal can set that bit immediately afterwards and free\ndd->port in mtip_hw_exit() while an ioctl still dereferences it. An already\nopen block device can reach the handlers while del_gendisk() is in\nprogress.\n\nSerialize both native and compat ioctls with removal. Set REMOVE_PENDING\nbefore taking the mutex so new callers fail after an in-flight ioctl has\ndrained, and hold the mutex until the port has been torn down.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:07:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:59:17", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/521afbd936ac256b7531470b0b9aa96abf9cd853", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8283049aa5fcb4e84b2b2928b2888903bb8ee12e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8a7799597bd683b6bc251fe2edfa9fd1db568a3a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4609e0e0be709e974bec9b52c5022136d25e97d3", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b389dc35a55713ac24a145741e76196fea1663bc", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/68940f841d013192086a0f6d7cfbac2cd079e228"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-90180", "GHSA-h84p-58mj-wq53"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0aad60ec-b524-3193-abab-202f0c092e29", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "88523a61558a040546bf7d8b079ae0755d8e7005 <68940f841d013192086a0f6d7cfbac2cd079e228"}, {"id": "1e4703fa-1a02-3e0a-998c-38b5b30fcc3b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.157"}, {"id": "29a89373-98a7-3026-b88b-a59d0dfc2977", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3.3"}, {"id": "3da1b0a0-f606-3ecb-b08c-69419a99ea91", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "88523a61558a040546bf7d8b079ae0755d8e7005 <8283049aa5fcb4e84b2b2928b2888903bb8ee12e"}, {"id": "5248050d-5f51-3073-ac78-b557855342df", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "88523a61558a040546bf7d8b079ae0755d8e7005 <521afbd936ac256b7531470b0b9aa96abf9cd853"}, {"id": "5bbfa8a5-16fd-3245-84ad-033c0851a723", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.6"}, {"id": "66540306-c381-3ced-a954-b2d870309abd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "7624e1f9-a129-3494-af2c-435e88bc8971", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "88523a61558a040546bf7d8b079ae0755d8e7005 <b389dc35a55713ac24a145741e76196fea1663bc"}, {"id": "93d0423b-7667-3b1d-bdee-b6d4ac38c534", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.188"}, {"id": "a9bf076b-49bb-31a2-ac6a-18d59f05f6e3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "88523a61558a040546bf7d8b079ae0755d8e7005 <4609e0e0be709e974bec9b52c5022136d25e97d3"}, {"id": "b9371d47-6ba1-3d03-b147-cb1f152bf54b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "d0b542fb-a2fa-3f11-a503-c4eb87a5106e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.110"}, {"id": "e7276a1e-8a48-3846-bc46-0b8552d3366e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "88523a61558a040546bf7d8b079ae0755d8e7005 <8a7799597bd683b6bc251fe2edfa9fd1db568a3a"}, {"id": "f02a0bdb-e3dd-3d02-8f44-6a7940d52147", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.52"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "ed8604e2-696b-3cd5-98c1-e277e5af9f47", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}